    "detailed_description": "Parking cars is easy and boring.  Parking cars <i>that have no brakes</i> is <strong>AWESOME!</strong><br><br>The goal of <strong>Emergency Parking Only</strong> is simple - park your cars within the lines for maximum cash, and smash everyone else's cars out of their spots.  Need some extra muscle?  Honk your horn while waiting for a new car and summon an ambulance, bank car, ice cream truck, or some other heavy vehicle and shove everyone out of the way.<br><br><strong>Emergency Parking Only</strong> supports up to four players in any combination of online multiplayer, game controllers from the couch, or even just crowding around the keyboard together.<br><br>The game is under active development, with new features, maps, vehicles, and more coming in the future.",
    "about_the_game": "Parking cars is easy and boring.  Parking cars <i>that have no brakes</i> is <strong>AWESOME!</strong><br><br>The goal of <strong>Emergency Parking Only</strong> is simple - park your cars within the lines for maximum cash, and smash everyone else's cars out of their spots.  Need some extra muscle?  Honk your horn while waiting for a new car and summon an ambulance, bank car, ice cream truck, or some other heavy vehicle and shove everyone out of the way.<br><br><strong>Emergency Parking Only</strong> supports up to four players in any combination of online multiplayer, game controllers from the couch, or even just crowding around the keyboard together.<br><br>The game is under active development, with new features, maps, vehicles, and more coming in the future.",
    "short_description": "A physics-based parking pileup for up to four players. Smash other players' cars out of the way while placing your own cars perfectly - all without any brakes. A delightfully silly party game that'll have you rolling!",
